    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i understand but i'm literally a zombie right now and i can't keep living like this. i'm not talking about taking a bunch of them, just like half a milligram of the ativan with my usual dose of seroquel. i've heard people do this all the time to help with sleep. surely a tiny bit wouldn't cause a major respiratory issue or anything like that? i just need to know if it's actually a life-threatening risk or if you're just being super cautious.",
